  "description": "OpenAI + OpenAI-compatible BYOK provider for Kuestenlogik.Bowire.Ai (#25 Phase 3). Registers an IBowireAiProviderFactory that builds an IChatClient via Microsoft.Extensions.AI.OpenAI; covers `openai` (api.openai.com) and `openrouter` (openrouter.ai) by passing different Endpoint base URLs through the same SDK. Add via `AddBowireAiOpenAi()` after `AddBowireAi()`. Bowire core + Kuestenlogik.Bowire.Ai stay free of OpenAI's transitive weight; only installs that need this provider pay for it.",
